    "turn_text": "means you can't pay attention to the issues. And also, you don't want to offend anyone because they might have money and who has money. Usually the large interest because they raise money now in big chunks, thousands of dollars at a time. It's not like you do a big sale or you have a $100 ticket, which is a lot for many people. But this is raised in $1000 chunks, $10,000 chunks. What ordinary American can do that? And over time, what we have is good people who wanted to serve their country getting caught in a very bad system.",
