    "turn_idx": 51,
    "turn_text": "where the salaries of airplane pilots have been cut and they lost, you know, 50, 70% of their pensions. When all these things have been happening to people, there's a loss of faith in the system. And that is very dangerous. And I think that we need to identify out of a nation of 300 million people, 535 people. that have a different way of looking at the future of this country. And it doesn't have to be this way. We don't have to have people who look at elected lives as a way to catapult themselves into something else. but rather as a way to serve the people and the republic.",
